<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 8: </span>Example of backtracking and overthinking. The model initially arrives at the correct answer, but begins to overthink and ventures into irrelevant reasoning trajectories which ended up giving an incorrect final answer.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A1.F9" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.21398v1/ECAI/img/incomplete.png" id="A1.F9.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:476/389;" width="476" height="389" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 9: </span>Example of incomplete generation in the final answer segment. Despite being prompted for the final answer, the model continues to reason until it hits the maximum token limit.</figcaption>
</figure>
