<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Performance metrics on the GSM8K dataset for 128 (a) and 512 (b) thinking tokens. As thinking tokens increase, we see a higher baseline accuracy and 2x-3x increase in token usage while substantially reducing incomplete generations for the Default and SFT+RL model. Furthermore, scaling factor drops for the SFT and SFT+RL model, but increases for the Default model.</figcaption>
</figure>
